abstract: >-
  Manifest-driven graph schema and ingestion for labeled property graphs:
  define schemas in GraphManifest (YAML/Python), ingest from CSV/JSON/Parquet/SQL/RDF/SPARQL/API/Kafka,
  infer from PostgreSQL 3NF or OWL/RDFS, apply schema migrations, and project to ArangoDB, Neo4j,
  TigerGraph, FalkorDB, Memgraph, NebulaGraph, PostgreSQL, or the file backend.
authors:
- affiliation: GrowGraph
  family-names: Belikov
  given-names: Alexander
  orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5649-0913
